    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Part of the \"Trench\" capsule collection, this Capucine BB is crafted from Mahogany-grained calf leather, paired with a brick-red handle and flap and finished with a tortoiseshell-effect resin LV logo — a rich palette that channels the full spirit of autumn. The standout detail is the leather strap and buckle worked into the side of the handle, an unmistakable nod to the belt of a trench coat that lends the piece an elegant, effortlessly chic French attitude.",
      "url": null,
