    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For Fall/Winter 2026, LOEWE introduces the new Puzzle Blown bag, which swaps traditional stitching for a high-frequency embossing technique that seals air and filling beneath the glossy lambskin. Combined with padded lining, it creates a three-dimensional, embossed effect that looks as though the bag has been inflated. Offered in black and bright orange, its minimalist construction reads as a sculptural, avant-garde statement.",
